# Canonicalize contributor identities so that `git shortlog -sne` shows one author instead of
# several display names. Every commit by the author was made under the same GitHub noreply
# email, with more than one display name; this maps that email to a single canonical name.
# The name is written in ASCII (as in the README) because CI rejects Turkish letters in
# tracked text files.
